<title>UK: Capital One sets $100 mln 30-year callable FRN.</title>
<headline>Capital One sets $100 mln 30-year callable FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAPITAL ONE</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 **	  MATURITY   *     2027</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     **	  PAY DATE</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BA3	 ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   1.0</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BB	  REOFFER    **</p>
<p> NOTES	 *CALLABLE AT PAR AFTER 10-YEARS</p>
<p>		**TO BE PRICED LIBOR +160 TO 170 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
